{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんはんは(﹡ˆᴗˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH0XNY50AKSF6VCYQHDSPRR","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにこの写真の白い服は裏表逆に着ていました。\nだからなんだか変です。ゆりちゃんに教えてもらいました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふたりで確認して笑ったのが面白かったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆりちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH0XPWJTEEXK0YKSJABX9H6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴらちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH0XQV2DPW5AB4802FEMQ0W","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、みいちゃんとよねさんが2人でこってこての関西弁で会話しているのをきくのが好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいているだけで微笑ましくてにこにこになります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この場合の『きく』は、聞く?聴く?どっちですっけ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意識的にきくから聴くなのかな〜?\n話をきくって聞くだよな、、(´-`).｡oO(うむむむ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気になります。\nとりあえず関西弁可愛いです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログお読みいただきありがとうございました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"cancamさんの乃木ザサイズの発売が待ち遠しくてたまりません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"からだ鍛えるぞ〜⊂((・⊥・))⊃"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長濱ねる"}],"source":"archive"}